invariant: INV-54
file: proof/coverage.py
catches: test/lint-matrix.sh
reason: reach_failure stops reading cbmc's "too many addressed objects",
  so the reach table says "not measured" for a run that the object limit
  stopped, and names no object_bits field. lint-matrix gives reach_table
  the line that cbmc wrote for rsa_avx2_chain and requires the cell for
  the object limit.

--- old
    for cause, texts in (("memory", REACH_MEMORY_TEXTS),
                         ("objects", (REACH_OBJECT_LIMIT_TEXT,))):
--- new
    for cause, texts in (("memory", REACH_MEMORY_TEXTS),):
